# The local persistent PostgreSQL cluster created by `npm run db:start`.
# Somebody's actual financial data — never commit it.
apps/api/.postgres-data/
# android/, ios/ and web/ are versioned deliberately. Each carries real project
# configuration that `flutter create` would silently reset: the bundle
# identifiers, the iOS App Transport Security policy, the Face ID and local
# network usage strings, and the PWA manifest. Losing those to a regenerated
# folder is how an app ships as com.example.something.
#
# The desktop targets are not shipped, so they stay generated.
apps/mobile/windows/
apps/mobile/macos/
apps/mobile/linux/

